      <h1 id="page-title">Answers for curious cat people.</h1>
      <p>
        Explore quick, practical answers about cat behavior, sleep habits, hydration, and indoor enrichment.
        All questions start collapsed so the page stays tidy and easy to scan.
      </p>
    </section>

