          <div>
            <div class="answer">
              <p><strong>Cats are natural energy conservers.</strong> Many adult cats sleep 12 to 16 hours a day because their bodies are built for short bursts of hunting-style activity followed by long rest periods.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
